<sect2 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" id="gimp-filter-hue-chroma">
  <title>Matiz Croma</title>
  
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Cores</primary>
    <secondary>Matiz-Croma</secondary>
  </indexterm>
  <indexterm>
    <primary>Matiz-Croma</primary>
  </indexterm>
  
  <para>O filtro Matiz-Croma é outra forma de modificar saturação. Explicações claras sobre croma e saturação podem ser encontradas em <ulink url="https://ninedegreesbelow.com/photography/changing-saturation-using-lch-chroma.html"/> .</para>
  
  <sect3>
    <title>Ativando o comando</title>
    <para>
      You can access this command from the main menu through
      <menuchoice>
        <guimenu>Colors</guimenu>
        <guimenuitem>Hue-Chroma…</guimenuitem>
      </menuchoice>.
    </para>
  </sect3>
  
  <sect3>
    <title>Opções</title>
    <figure>
      <title>Opções de Matiz-Croma</title>
      <mediaobject>
        <imageobject>
          <imagedata fileref="images/menus/colors/hue-chroma-dialog.png" format="PNG"/>
        </imageobject>
      </mediaobject>
    </figure>
    <variablelist>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Predefinições</term>
        <term>Opções de Mistura</term>
        <term>Preview</term>
        <term>Merge filter</term>
        <term>Split view</term>
        <listitem>
          <xi:include href="about-common-features.xml"/>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Matiz</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            The slider and the <guilabel>+</guilabel> and
            <guilabel>-</guilabel> buttons allow you to select a hue in the
            color wheel (-180°, 180°).
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Croma</term>
        <listitem>
          <para><quote>Croma</quote> é a pureza da cor. Mover este controle torna as cores mais ou menos puras.</para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
      <varlistentry>
        <term>Brilho</term>
        <listitem>
          <para>
            This slider and the <guilabel>+</guilabel> and
            <guilabel>-</guilabel> buttons allow you to select a value
            (luminosity): -100, 100.
          </para>
        </listitem>
      </varlistentry>
    </variablelist>
  </sect3>
  
</sect2>
